<title>USA: United Dental buys two dental firms.</title>
<headline>United Dental buys two dental firms.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dental Care Inc said on Wednesday it has agreed to acquire Kansas City Dental Care Inc and Independent Dental Plans Inc for undisclosed sums.</p>
<p>Kansas City Dental provides managed dental benefits to over 90,000 members in Missouri and Kansas, the company said.</p>
<p>Independent Dental is a small managed dental benefits plan in Michigan, United Dental said.</p>
